{key: C}
{tempo: 125}
{time: 4/4}

{comment: Intro}
| [C] | ×8

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
If we have food and clothing [F]we are content
[C]Those who want to get [Am7]rich fall into a [Dm7]trap [G7]
[C]Many senseless desires plunge [F]people into ruin
A [Dm7]trap for the soul and a [G7]harmful de[C]sire
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Pre-Chorus}
Love of money is a root of all kinds of e[F]vil
[C]Reaching for it they have [Am7]wandered away from [Dm7]faith [G7]
[C]Pierced through with many sorrows and [F]deep despair
[Dm7]They have lost their way [G7]in the world of [C]pain
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
Flee from all this man of God to[F]day
Pursue [C]righteousness and [Am7]godliness and [Dm7]faith [G7]
[C]Endurance and love and gentleness keep [F]close
[Dm7]Hold on to the life [G7]that is yours to [C]keep
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
Fight the good fight of the faith with all your [F]might
Take [C]hold of the eternal [Am7]life you were called [Dm7]to [G7]
[C]You made the good confession be[F]fore many witnesses
Stand [Dm7]firm in the [G7]truth that you have re[C]ceived
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
Flee from all this man of God to[F]day
Pursue [C]righteousness and [Am7]godliness and [Dm7]faith [G7]
En[C]durance and love and gentleness keep [F]close
[Dm7]Hold on to the life [G7]that is yours to [C]keep
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_bridge: Bridge}
[F]In the presence of God [G7]who gives life to [C]all
[F]Before Christ [G7]Jesus who confessed before Pi[C]late
[F]Keep this com[G7]mand without [C]stain or [G/B]any re[Am]proach
[Dm7]Until the appearing of our Lord [G7]Jesus
{end_of_bridge}

{start_of_chorus: Chorus}
Flee [C]from all this man of God today
Pur[F]sue righteous[C]ness and godli[Am7]ness and [Dm7]faith [G7]
En[C]durance and love and gentleness keep close
